p1  ¦  2026-01-01 10:02:00  ¦  2026-01-01 10:03:00  ¦  3  𝄀
p2  ¦  2026-01-01 11:00:00  ¦  2026-01-01 11:01:00  ¦  7  𝄀
p3  ¦  2026-01-01 23:59:00  ¦  2026-01-02 00:00:00  ¦  10  𝄀
p3  ¦  2026-01-02 00:00:00  ¦  2026-01-02 00:01:00  ¦  null  𝄀
p3  ¦  2026-01-02 00:01:00  ¦  2026-01-02 00:02:00  ¦  30
